XFAIL: system-windows

Output that is not text (every byte value, NUL included) reaches the parent
byte for byte through catter.
Known failures: #139 (output line endings are rewritten on Windows).

RUN: %e2e probe binary-output | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe binary-output | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS binary-output
